WEBVTT

00:08:25.355 --> 00:08:30.396
but in many ways,
I was the kind of break point,

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.944
where I could not scale to the point

00:08:32.968 --> 00:08:35.768
where I could work
with thousands of people.

00:08:35.792 --> 00:08:38.244
So Git is my second big project,

00:08:38.268 --> 00:08:42.806
which was only created for me
to maintain my first big project.

00:08:43.433 --> 00:08:45.680
And this is literally how I work.

00:08:45.704 --> 00:08:48.209
I don't code for --

00:08:48.233 --> 00:08:49.955
well, I do code for fun --

00:08:49.979 --> 00:08:52.360
but I want to code
for something meaningful

00:08:52.384 --> 00:08:56.431
so every single project I've ever done
has been something I needed

00:08:56.455 --> 00:08:57.831
and --

00:08:57.855 --> 00:09:01.288
CA: So really, both Linux
and Git kind of arose